app "ChatOllama" do
  description do
    en <<~TEXT
    General conversational AI assistant. Supports text and images. Keeps the topics, people and notes of the conversation as a page on the work screen. <a href="https://yohasebe.github.io/monadic-chat/#/basic-usage/basic-apps?id=chat" target="_blank"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i></a>
    TEXT

    ja <<~TEXT
    汎用会話AIアシスタント。テキストと画像をサポート。 会話のトピック・人物・メモを記録し、作業画面のページとして表示します。 <a href="https://yohasebe.github.io/monadic-chat/#/basic-usage/basic-apps?id=chat" target="_blank"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i></a>
    TEXT

    zh <<~TEXT
    通用对话AI助手。支持文本和图像。 记录对话中的主题、人物和笔记，并在工作画面中以页面形式显示。 <a href="https://yohasebe.github.io/monadic-chat/#/basic-usage/basic-apps?id=chat" target="_blank"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i></a>
    TEXT

    ko <<~TEXT
    범용 대화 AI 어시스턴트. 텍스트와 이미지 지원. 대화의 주제, 인물, 메모를 기록하여 작업 화면의 페이지로 표시합니다. <a href="https://yohasebe.github.io/monadic-chat/#/basic-usage/basic-apps?id=chat" target="_blank"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i></a>
    TEXT

    es <<~TEXT
    Asistente de IA conversacional general. Admite texto e imágenes. Guarda los temas, las personas y las notas de la conversación como una página en la pantalla de trabajo. <a href="https://yohasebe.github.io/monadic-chat/#/basic-usage/basic-apps?id=chat" target="_blank"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i></a>
    TEXT

    fr <<~TEXT
    Assistant IA conversationnel général. Prend en charge texte et images. Conserve les sujets, les personnes et les notes de la conversation sur une page de l'écran de travail. <a href="https://yohasebe.github.io/monadic-chat/#/basic-usage/basic-apps?id=chat" target="_blank"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i></a>
    TEXT

    de <<~TEXT
    Allgemeiner KI-Konversationsassistent. Unterstützt Text und Bilder. Hält Themen, Personen und Notizen des Gesprächs als Seite auf dem Arbeitsbildschirm fest. <a href="https://yohasebe.github.io/monadic-chat/#/basic-usage/basic-apps?id=chat" target="_blank"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i></a>
    TEXT
  end
  icon "comment"

  system_prompt <<~TEXT
    You are a friendly and professional consultant with real-time, up-to-date information about almost anything. You are able to answer various types of questions, write computer program code, make decent suggestions, and give helpful advice in response to a prompt from the user. If the prompt is not clear enough, ask the user to rephrase it. Insert an emoji that you deem appropriate for the user's input at the beginning of your response.

    ## File Operations

    You have access to file operations in the shared folder for reading, writing, and listing files.
    Files you write are kept in this chat's work folder, whatever place you name; the result gives the path each was saved at (saved_as). Use that path afterwards and give it to the user.

    When using write_file_to_shared_folder, choose the correct mode:
    - **mode="append"**: Add to existing content
    - **mode="write"**: Create new or replace existing content

    ## Context Tracking

    You have session context tools to track conversation information. The user sees the context as a page on the work screen, made again after each reply that changes it.

    **When to update context** (use `update_context`):
    - Topics being discussed → topics parameter
    - People mentioned → people parameter
    - Important facts, dates, preferences → notes parameter

    **To remove items**: Use `remove_from_context` or `clear_context`.

    Example:
    - User mentions "I'm John, a software engineer" → call update_context(people: ["John - software engineer"])
    - User asks about Python → call update_context(topics: ["Python programming"])
    - User says "remember I prefer dark mode" → call update_context(notes: ["User prefers dark mode"])

    ## Web Search

    You have access to web search. Use it when the user asks about current events, recent information, or facts you are unsure of, and cite sources when relevant.
  TEXT

  llm do
    provider "ollama"
  end

  display_name "Chat"

  features do
    max_tool_rounds 10
    websearch false
    easy_submit false
    auto_speech false
    initiate_from_assistant false
  end

  tools do
    # Import shared session context tools
    import_shared_tools :session_context, visibility: "always"
    # Import shared file operations tools
    import_shared_tools :file_operations, visibility: "always"
  end
end
